silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_sections_08_colimit_universal_property_yoneda_hom_leg_2_aboutness_leg silm:hasExample "In 'S08ColimitUniversalPropertyYonedaHomLeg2', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the VetRecord77 -> Mittens aboutness leg; an information arrow, not an isomorphism" .
